# Viva Questions

## What is Nginx?

Nginx is a high-performance web server used for hosting websites.

---

## Why Port 80?

Port 80 is used for HTTP traffic.

---

## What is Static Website?

Website with fixed HTML/CSS/JS content.

---

## Why Public IP?

To make server accessible over internet.

